# The image needs exactly two things: the server's sources and the built web
# bundle. Everything else (the Flutter project itself, 800 question images that
# are already inside build/web, Xcode and Gradle output) stays out of the
# context — it would only make every deploy slower.
*

!web_server/Cargo.toml
!web_server/Cargo.lock
!web_server/src
!web_server/well_known

!build/web

web_server/target
**/.DS_Store
